Third-party material vendored for waydroid-audio-hal
====================================================

This directory holds headers needed to compile audio.primary.cras.so
against the Android legacy audio HAL interface.  It mixes AOSP material
with a file written at NAVER; the split is recorded here because four of
the AOSP files carry no copyright header of their own, so their origin
cannot be told from the files themselves.


